Revision history for Perl-Critic-Policy-ProhibitMisplacedMethods

{{$NEXT}}
    - A string that starts with a digit, such as 1Foo, in use parent, use base,
      extends or @ISA is no longer taken as a parent class.

0.001 2026-10-22 TEODESIAN
    - Initial release.  Reports a sub that only one subclass uses, and a sub
      that two subclasses define where the class above them defines none.
